WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.413
Lucy stopped the spaceship.

2
00:00:03.414 --> 00:00:06.095
The satellite was close.

3
00:00:06.096 --> 00:00:12.069
But space junk was all around it.

4
00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:15.349
"Well, Ringo," Lucy said.

5
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:18.848
"How can we clean that mess?"

6
00:00:18.849 --> 00:00:25.744
Ringo scratched his head.

7
00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:28.788
Bing! Bot's light flashed.

8
00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:34.043
"We can use a space net!"

9
00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:39.748
Ringo and Lucy put on rocket packs.

10
00:00:39.749 --> 00:00:52.221
Everyone went outside.

11
00:00:52.222 --> 00:00:58.102
Lucy zoomed around.

12
00:00:58.103 --> 00:01:09.957
"This is fun!"

13
00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:14.529
"Everyone, hold the net," Ringo said.

14
00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:20.705
An old wheel floated into the net.

15
00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:23.162
"Yes!" Ringo said.

16
00:01:23.163 --> 00:01:27.489
Next they caught a rusty shovel.

17
00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:32.125
Then they caught a toy spaceship.

18
00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:51.872
They caught all sorts of things.

19
00:01:51.873 --> 00:01:55.953
Ringo smiled. "We're done.

20
00:01:55.954 --> 00:01:58.837
We make a good team!"

21
00:01:58.838 --> 00:02:02.881
Lucy shrugged. "I guess so."

22
00:02:02.882 --> 00:02:05.768
Bot looked around.

23
00:02:05.769 --> 00:02:10.159
"Where's the satellite?"

24
00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:13.577
Ringo was looking at the spaceship.

25
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:17.855
"Why is our spaceship shaking?"

26
00:02:17.856 --> 00:02:20.310
"Something hit it," PJ said.

27
00:02:20.311 --> 00:02:23.257
"I'll check it out," Bot said.

28
00:02:23.258 --> 00:02:29.933
Bot flew to the spaceship.

29
00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:32.735
"The satellite!" Bot said.

30
00:02:32.736 --> 00:02:36.036
It was stuck in the engine.

31
00:02:36.037 --> 00:02:38.536
Bot grabbed the satellite.

32
00:02:38.537 --> 00:02:41.534
She pulled and pulled.

33
00:02:41.535 --> 00:02:45.148
But the satellite did not move.

34
00:02:45.149 --> 00:02:48.152
"Uh-oh," Bot said.

35
00:02:48.153 --> 00:02:55.415
"This is not good!"

